fonts-firacode (5.2+dfsg1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Follow suit with upstream and provide TTF instead of OTF font
    files (Closes: #962478, thanks Salim B).
    + Add fonttools and ttfautohint to Build-Depends.
    + Install gftools-fix-dsig.py from googlefonts/gftools into
      debian/scripts.
    + Update debian/copyright accordingly.
    + Use upstream build scripts to build the fonts.
    + Patch upstream build scripts to use the embedded
      gftools-fix-dsig.py script.
    + Adjust packaging install and clean paths.

