fonts-firacode (1.206+dfsg1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream version 1.206+dfsg1.
  * Repack the upstream tarball without any binary font files.
  * Add Build-Depends on fontmake (>= 1.8.0).
    This implies glyphslib (>= 3.1.1) and ufo2ft (>= 2.3.0), thanks to
    Yao Wei and Jeremy Bicha for making these available in Debian!
  * Add Build-Depends on sfnt2woff-zopfli and woff2.
  * Build the OTF fonts from the Glyphs source and
    build the WOFF and WOFF2 variants from the OTF font.
  * Move package from Section contrib/fonts to Debian main. \o/

 -- Fabian Greffrath <fabian@debian.org>  Sat, 22 Dec 2018 12:45:37 +0100

